 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t a single objectively “best” title company—it depends on your lender’s requirements, location, fees, and how responsive the team is. **Community Title Services** is one local option worth checking: it reports more than 115 five-star Google reviews and is based in the St. Louis area. **Investors Title** and **Select Title Group** also offer residential title and closing services locally.\n\nBefore choosing, ask for a written estimate of title and closing fees, confirm they can meet your closing date and work with your lender, and check recent reviews for the specific office or closing team. You can generally choose the title company yourself, but confirm with your lender and purchase contract first.",
